{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0201","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:00000114:text","row":29529,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"教室には冬子がいた。","en":"Touko is in the classroom.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800353","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00001","en":"Touko was in the classroom.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:00000140:text","row":29530,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"杖に突っ伏して寝ている。","en":"She's asleep, slumped over her cane.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00002","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00002","en":"Bent over the desk, sleeping.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:00000170:text","row":29531,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"ずっとここで座っていたのか。","en":"Has she been sitting here all this time?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800354","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00003","en":"Been sitting here all along, perhaps.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:000001a4:text","row":29532,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"みみ先輩や友貴みたく部活に逃げることも、","en":"No club to escape into, like Mimi and Tomoki.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800355","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00004","en":"She doesn't have the escape into club that Mimi-senpai and Tomoki have,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:000001e4:text","row":29533,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"俺のような安堵の日々も、","en":"No days of respite like mine.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800356","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00005","en":"nor days of relief like I,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:00000214:text","row":29534,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"曜子ちゃんのような鉄壁なエゴさえもない。","en":"Not even an ironclad ego like Youko's.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800357","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00006","en":"not even the impregnable fortress of an ego like Youko-chan.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:00000254:text","row":29535,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"冬子には逃げる場所がないのかもしれない。","en":"Maybe Touko has nowhere to escape to.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800358","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00007","en":"Touko might have nowhere to escape to, perhaps.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:00000294:text","row":29536,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"それは……前も同様だ。","en":"But... that was true before too.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800359","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00008","en":"This is... just like before.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:000002c2:text","row":29537,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"人類滅亡前の世界でも。","en":"Even before humanity vanished.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800360","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00009","en":"In the world that was before the fall of mankind,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:000002f0:text","row":29538,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"冬子は一人だった。","en":"Touko had been alone.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800361","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00010","en":"Touko was also alone.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:0000031a:text","row":29539,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"ずっと虚勢を張って生きてきた。","en":"She'd spent her whole life bluffing her way through.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800362","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00011","en":"A life of endlessly pretending to be brave.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:00000350:text","row":29540,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"だから一度ほつれると脆かったんだ。","en":"That was why she was so fragile once she began to unravel.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800363","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00012","en":"That's why she was brittle, once she became frayed.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:0000038a:text","row":29541,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"近寄って、声をかける。","en":"I go over and call to her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800364","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00013","en":"I draw near and call out.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:000003c0:text","row":29542,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「冬子」","en":"“Touko.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800365","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00014","en":"Taichi: \"Touko.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:000003e8:text","row":29543,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800366","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00015","en":"Touko: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:00000410:text","row":29544,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「とーこ」","en":"“Toukooo.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800367","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00016","en":"Taichi: \"Tooouko.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:00000457:text","row":29545,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「……うぅん」","en":"“...Mmm.”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800368","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00017","en":"Touko: \"...nnngh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:0000047d:text","row":29546,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"身じろぐ。","en":"She stirs.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800369","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00018","en":"Stirring,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:0000049f:text","row":29547,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"だが起きない。","en":"But doesn't wake.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800370","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00019","en":"yet not waking.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:000004cd:text","row":29548,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「サンドイッチ食べるか？」","en":"“Want a sandwich?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800371","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00020","en":"Taichi: \"Wanna eat sandwiches?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:00000524:text","row":29549,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「……食欲、ないから……」","en":"“...I’m not hungry...”","speakerJa":"冬子","speakerEn":"Touko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800372","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00021","en":"Touko: \"...but I have... no appetite.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:00000556:text","row":29550,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"呼吸が、すぐに寝息に戻る。","en":"Her breathing falls right back into the rhythm of sleep.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800373","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00022","en":"Her breathing quickly returned to a sleeper's.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:00000590:text","row":29551,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうか」","en":"“Okay.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800374","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00023","en":"Taichi: \"Right.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:000005b2:text","row":29552,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"心なしかやつれている。","en":"She looks a little haggard. Or maybe that's my imagination.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800375","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00024","en":"Somewhat emaciated.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:000005e0:text","row":29553,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"ちゃんと食べてるのか、コイツ。","en":"Was she even eating?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800376","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00025","en":"This lady... is she even eating properly.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0201:00000616:text","row":29554,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"ポケットからあめ玉を取り出し、机の上に転がした。","en":"I take a piece of hard candy from my pocket and roll it onto the desk.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800377","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0029a:00026","en":"I take some sweets out of my pocket and let them roll out onto the desk.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]}]}
